    "trapAlertEn": "⚠️ Level B1 Trap Alert (Excursion Itinerary): Watch out for lexical lures and over-extrapolation traps! Do not confuse the verified answer (Option B: \"Bring warm clothing and a windbreaker\") with distractor options (Option A, Option C, Option D) which reuse text words but distort the core meaning.",
