    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option C (\"By filling out the registry at city hall or online\")\n\n• Textual Evidence (Notice of enquête publique municipale):\nIn response to \"How can residents submit their feedback on the park project?\", the passage states: \"CITIZENSHIP — PUBLIC CONSULTATION ON PARK REDEVELOPMENT: City hall invites residents to share feedback on creating a children's playground and dog park. Feedback registry available at city hall reception or online until November 25.\".\nOption C (\"By filling out the registry at city hall or online\") accurately conveys the essential information presented in the text.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options):\n  - Option A (\"By writing a formal letter to the regional governor\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"By writing a formal letter to the regional governor\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option B (\"By attending a public protest march on Saturday\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"By attending a public protest march on Saturday\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option C (\"By filling out the registry at city hall or online\") [CORRECT]: Accurately conveys the passage's verified meaning without distortion.\n  - Option D (\"By calling the local police station directly\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"By calling the local police station directly\") that distort explicit passage figures."
