    "trapAlertEn": "⚠️ Level B1 Trap Alert (Article on  tourisme éco-responsable): Watch out for lexical lures and over-extrapolation traps! Do not confuse the verified answer (Option C: \"Minimizing the environmental carbon footprint of their stay\") with distractor options (Option A, Option B, Option D) which reuse text words but distort the core meaning.",
