    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option C (\"Minimizing the environmental carbon footprint of their stay\")\n\n• Textual Evidence (Article on  tourisme éco-responsable):\nIn response to \"Expectation of travelers staying in these mountain eco-lodges:\", the passage states: \"SUSTAINABLE TOURISM — CITIZEN TRAVELER BULLETIN: EXPANDING ECO-LODGES IN MOUNTAINS.\n\nMountain lodge owners are renovating accommodations to meet strict green standards: solar water heaters, compost toilets, wood fiber insulation, and local food sourcing. These upgrades meet growing demands from hikers seeking low-carbon vacations.\n\nEco-friendly tourism protects wild mountain beauty while supporting local businesses.\".\nOption C (\"Minimizing the environmental carbon footprint of their stay\") accurately conveys the essential information presented in the text.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options):\n  - Option A (\"Having powerful air conditioners running in every room\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"Having powerful air conditioners running in every room\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option B (\"Requesting imported industrial pre-packaged meals daily\") [INCORRECT - LEXICAL LURE & UNSTATED ASSUMPTION TRAP]: Reuses passage keywords (\"Requesting imported industrial pre-packaged meals daily\") while introducing an unstated assumption or off-topic conclusion.\n  - Option C (\"Minimizing the environmental carbon footprint of their stay\") [CORRECT]: Accurately conveys the passage's verified meaning without distortion.\n  - Option D (\"Accessing mountain peaks strictly via private helicopters\") [INCORRECT - LEXICAL LURE & UNSTATED ASSUMPTION TRAP]: Reuses passage keywords (\"Accessing mountain peaks strictly via private helicopters\") while introducing an unstated assumption or off-topic conclusion."
