    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option D (\"Superior natural resilience against plant diseases and climate stress\")\n\n• Textual Evidence (Report on  biodiversité agricole):\nIn response to \"Agronomic asset of traditional heirloom seeds highlighted in the study:\", the passage states: \"AGRICULTURE AND ECOLOGY — HEIRLOOM VARIETIES BULLETIN: PRESERVING TRADITIONAL HEIRLOOM SEEDS.\n\nIndustrial farm standardization led to the loss of thousands of heirloom grain, fruit, and vegetable varieties replaced by a few patented commercial hybrid seeds. Preserving crop biodiversity, farmer networks save and trade heirloom seeds adapted to local soils.\n\nHeirloom varieties feature superior natural resilience against diseases and climate stress, reducing chemical treatment needs while yielding exceptional flavor.\".\nOption D (\"Superior natural resilience against plant diseases and climate stress\") accurately conveys the essential information presented in the text.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options):\n  - Option A (\"Mandatory requirements to apply heavy synthetic chemical fertilizers\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"Mandatory requirements to apply heavy synthetic chemical fertilizers\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option B (\"Inability to store harvested produce longer than 24 hours\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"Inability to store harvested produce longer than 24 hours\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option C (\"Necessity to purchase new patented seeds from corporations annually\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"Necessity to purchase new patented seeds from corporations annually\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option D (\"Superior natural resilience against plant diseases and climate stress\") [CORRECT]: Accurately conveys the passage's verified meaning without distortion."
