    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option D (\"Developing teamwork and respect for marine elements\")\n\n• Textual Evidence (Article on  préservation du patrimoine maritime):\nIn response to \"Educational goal of sailing trips aboard restored historic wooden sailboats:\", the passage states: \"MARITIME CULTURE — TRADITIONAL SAILING REVIEW: RESTORING HISTORIC WOODEN SAILBOATS.\n\nPassionate shipwrights restore historic wooden fishing sailboats saved from scrapping. Employing traditional oak-shaping and oakum-caulking techniques, artisans preserve invaluable naval heritage.\n\nRefloated, these traditional rigs join heritage regattas and host youth integration sailing trips centered on teamwork and marine element respect.\".\nOption D (\"Developing teamwork and respect for marine elements\") accurately conveys the essential information presented in the text.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options):\n  - Option A (\"Training high-speed motor race boat drivers\") [INCORRECT - LEXICAL LURE & UNSTATED ASSUMPTION TRAP]: Reuses passage keywords (\"Training high-speed motor race boat drivers\") while introducing an unstated assumption or off-topic conclusion.\n  - Option B (\"Selling fresh sea-caught fish at local commercial markets\") [INCORRECT - LEXICAL LURE & UNSTATED ASSUMPTION TRAP]: Reuses passage keywords (\"Selling fresh sea-caught fish at local commercial markets\") while introducing an unstated assumption or off-topic conclusion.\n  - Option C (\"Forcing trainees to scrap wooden sailboats for firewood\") [INCORRECT - NUMERICAL OR TEMPORAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Uses inaccurate numerical or temporal anchors (\"Forcing trainees to scrap wooden sailboats for firewood\") that distort explicit passage figures.\n  - Option D (\"Developing teamwork and respect for marine elements\") [CORRECT]: Accurately conveys the passage's verified meaning without distortion."
